  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NUM 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yub tum aryo me ryal ma ibitetogi ki nyol, ci ibitic kwedgi me lwoŋo lwak ki pi cako wot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka gikuto tum aryo ducu, ci lwak ducu gibicokke kacel boti i doggola kema me rwatte, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento ka gikuto tum acel keken, ci lutel wic, ma gin ludito ma i kaka ducu pa jo Icrael, gibicokke kacel boti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka wukuto okok maloŋo kicel, ci gony ma yo tun wokceŋ gibicako wot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka wukuto okok maloŋo tyen me aryone, ci gony ducu ma yo tun acuc gibicako wot. Gibikuto tum kok maloŋo me cako wot anyim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento ka wumito coko lwak kacel wubikuto, ento pe wukut okok maloŋo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awobe pa Aron, ma gin aye ajwagi, gibikuto tumo Cik me kuto tum bibedo botwu cik matwal nio wa i kare pa likwayowu ducu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka wucito i mony ka lweny ki lukworwu ma gidiyowu i lobowu, ci wubimiyo oduru mony kok kun wukuto tum, wek Rwot Lubaŋawu opo piwu ci olarwu ki bot lukworwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I nino ma cwinywu yom iye bene, ki i nino madito ma gicikowu pigi, ki i kare me por dwe ducu, wubikuto iye tum i wi gitum awaŋa mewu, ki i wi gitum mewu me gityer lakwecwiny; gibikutogi wek Lubaŋa opo piwu; an a Rwot Lubaŋawu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I mwaka me aryone, i dwe me aryone, i kom nino dwe pyeraryo, pol ocako warre woko ki i wi kema lok me caden, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omiyo jo Icrael gucako wot, gua woko ki i tim Cinai kun giwoto, gikobo; ci pol ocito ocuŋ wa i tim Paran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gudak tyen man mukwoŋo kit ma Rwot yam ociko ki Moses. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bendera me gony pa jo pa Juda aye gutelo yo ki buca monygi ducu; lawimonygi aye Nakucon wod pa Aminadab. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lawimony me kaka pa Icakar obedo Natanel wod pa Juar, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ki lawimony me kaka pa Jabulon obedo Eliab wod pa Kelon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kema pa Rwot doŋ giputo, ci likwayo pa Gercon ki likwayo pa Merari ma gitiŋo kema, gucako wotgi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki bendera me gony pa jo pa Reuben ocako wot ki buca monygi ducu; lawimonygi obedo Elijur wod pa Cedeur ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lawimony me kaka pa Cimeon obedo Celumiel wod pa Juricadai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lawimony me kaka pa Gad obedo Eliacap wod pa Deuel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok jo pa Kokat gucako wot, kun gitiŋo jami maleŋ ducu; kema onoŋo doŋ giguro ocuŋ ma peya guo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dok bendera me gony pa jo pa Epraim ocako wot ki buca monygi ducu; lawimonygi obedo Elicama wod pa Amikud. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lawimony me kaka pa Manace obedo Gamaliel wod pa Pedajur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lawimony me kaka pa Benjamin obedo Abidan wod pa Gideoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lacen bendera me gony pa jo pa Dan ocako wot ki buca monygi ducu, kun gicoko ŋe gony ducu; lawimony megi obedo Akiejer wod pa Amicadai, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lawimony me kaka pa Acer obedo Pagiel wod pa Okoran, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lawimony me kaka pa Naputali obedo Akira wod pa Enan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man aye onoŋo kit wot pa jo Icrael, ma lubo buca monygi, i kare ma gimol me cako wot.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses owaco bot Kobab wod pa Reuel ma Lamidian, won dakone, ni, “Wan wacako wot wadak i kabedo ma Rwot cen owaco pire ni ebimiyowa-ni. Ber iwot kwedwa, ci wabitimi maber.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Kobab owacce ni, “An pe abicito; abidok i lobo tuwa ki bot lutuwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses ogamo ni, “Alegi, pe iwekwa, pien in iŋeyo ni wabigony i tim, ci ibibedo botwa ma ka wanwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok ka ibiwoto kwedwa, gin maber ducu ma Rwot bitimo i komwa, wan bene wabitimi kit meno.”",
